---
import '@fontsource/instrument-serif/400.css';
import '@fontsource/noto-serif-sc/700.css';
import '@fontsource/jetbrains-mono/400.css';
import Bloom from '../components/Bloom.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>数字作品室 · 纪鸣飞 — Bloom / World Atlas / 沿途</title>
  <meta name="description" content="纪鸣飞的数字作品室：可以绽放的三维芍药、世界智能地图与沿途 AI 旅行规划。体验设计、AI 产品与可运行作品。" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://mingfeiji.github.io/studio/" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="数字作品室 · 纪鸣飞" /><meta property="og:description" content="把想法，做成可以体验的作品。" /><meta property="og:type" content="website" /><meta property="og:image" content="https://mingfeiji.github.io/projects/bloom.jpg" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0c1915" />
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip" href="#main">跳到作品内容</a>
  <nav aria-label="主导航"><a class="brand" href="/">纪鸣飞<span> / MINGFEI JI</span></a><div><a href="/resume/">职业概览</a><a href="#selected">全部作品 <span>03</span></a><a href="mailto:1966315939@qq.com">联系 ↗</a></div></nav>
  <main id="main">
    <header class="studio-intro"><p class="eyebrow">THE DIGITAL STUDIO — SELECTED EXPERIMENTS</p><h1>把想法，<br class="mobile-break" />做成可以体验的作品<span>。</span></h1><div class="intro-bottom"><p>业务之外，继续探索产品的另一面：<br class="mobile-break" />空间、交互，以及一点美感。</p><a href="/resume/">看我的 AI 产品实践 ↗</a></div></header>
    <section class="bloom-feature" id="bloom" aria-labelledby="bloom-title">
      <div class="bloom-story"><div class="work-id"><span>01 / DIGITAL BOTANY</span><span class="live-dot">可交互作品</span></div><h2 id="bloom-title">Bloom<span>.</span></h2><h3>让一朵花，慢慢绽放。</h3><p>从一片花瓣开始，把时间的变化<br />留在可以触碰的数字空间里。</p><div class="bloom-spec"><span>芍药 <em>PAEONIA</em></span><span>103 片花瓣 · 三种材质</span></div><a class="text-link" href="https://mingteck.com/flower" target="_blank" rel="noopener">进入数字庭园 <span>↗</span></a></div>
      <Bloom />
      <div class="feature-caption"><span>同一份原作模型 · 在这里旋转、绽放与切换材质</span><span>BLENDER → WEBGL</span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="selected" id="selected" aria-labelledby="selected-title"><div class="section-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTINUE EXPLORING</p><h2 id="selected-title">从一朵花，到更大的世界。</h2></div><span>02 — 03</span></div>
      <div class="project-pair">
        <article class="project atlas"><a class="project-image" href="https://mingteck.com/atlas" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="打开 World Atlas 世界智能地图"><img src="/projects/atlas.jpg" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" alt="World Atlas 原站实景：三维地球、城市选择与地点资料" /><span class="image-action">探索三维世界 ↗</span></a><div class="project-copy"><p class="eyebrow">02 / SPATIAL EXPLORATION</p><h3>World Atlas<span>世界智能地图</span></h3><p>从地球走近城市与地标，在同一界面查看地点、时间与来源。让空间成为理解信息的入口。</p><div class="project-foot"><span>3D 地球 · 城市与地标 · 时间轴</span><a href="https://mingteck.com/atlas" target="_blank" rel="noopener">体验作品 ↗</a></div></div></article>
        <article class="project yantu"><a class="project-image" href="https://mingteck.com/web" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="打开沿途 YANTU 旅行规划"><img src="/projects/yantu.jpg" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" alt="沿途 YANTU 原站实景：AI 旅行规划界面" /><span class="image-action">打开旅行规划 ↗</span></a><div class="project-copy"><p class="eyebrow">03 / AI TRAVEL PRODUCT</p><h3>沿途<span>YANTU</span></h3><p>从一句旅行想法，到一份按天展开、可以调整和保存的行程。把 AI 的回答，变成持续可用的产品。</p><div class="project-foot"><span>行程规划 · Web / 手机 · 本机保存</span><a href="https://mingteck.com/web" target="_blank" rel="noopener">体验产品 ↗</a></div></div></article>
      </div>
      <p class="original-note">作品来自我的 mingteck.com。展示图为原站实景；地图与旅行规划将打开完整产品。</p>
    </section>
    <section class="bridge"><p class="eyebrow">THE SAME WAY OF BUILDING</p><h2>从真实业务出发，<br />把产品做得有用，也有感受。</h2><p>TripFlow、TripYoyo 与这些个人作品，<br />都是我把需求、设计、工程与反馈连在一起的实践。</p><div><a class="button" href="/resume/">查看职业概览 <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/prototypes/">探索产品原型 ↗</a></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer><a href="/">纪鸣飞 / Mingfei Ji</a><span>AI PRODUCT × DESIGN × BUILD</span><a href="mailto:1966315939@qq.com">一起做点有意思的事 ↗</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
<style>
  :global(*){box-sizing:border-box}:global(html){background:#0c1915;color:#e9e5d7;scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:32px}:global(body){margin:0;font:14px/1.8 'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',system-ui,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}:global(a){color:inherit;text-decoration:none}:global(a:focus-visible){outline:2px solid #c8b17a;outline-offset:6px}:global(h1),:global(h2),:global(h3),:global(p){margin:0}.skip{position:absolute;top:-70px;left:20px;background:#e9e5d7;color:#0c1915;padding:10px;z-index:10}.skip:focus{top:10px}nav{max-width:1360px;margin:auto;padding:28px 56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #2c3a30}nav>div{display:flex;gap:30px;font-size:12px;color:#b7bfb1}.brand{font-size:18px;letter-spacing:.08em}.brand span{font:9px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;margin-left:14px;color:#9ca897}nav>div span{font-size:9px;color:#c8b17a;margin-left:4px}main{max-width:1360px;margin:auto;padding:0 56px}.eyebrow{font:10px/1.8 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#bdac81}.studio-intro{padding:52px 0 40px}h1{font-family:'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-size:clamp(27px,3.25vw,44px);line-height:1.6;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.015em;margin-top:12px}h1>span{color:#c8b17a}.intro-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:#aab5a5}.intro-bottom>a{font-size:11px;border-bottom:1px solid #59634b;padding-bottom:2px}.mobile-break{display:none}.bloom-feature{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr;background:#11241b;border:1px solid #33473480;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}.bloom-story{padding:38px 0 32px 42px;position:relative;z-index:1;align-self:center}.work-id{font:9px/1.8 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#a6b19d;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px}.live-dot{font-family:system-ui;font-size:10px;color:#bbc4ac}.live-dot:before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:5px;height:5px;background:#b8bf84;border-radius:50%;margin-right:7px}.bloom-story h2{font:clamp(85px,9.5vw,132px)/1.12 'Instrument Serif',serif;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:28px 0 14px}.bloom-story h2 span{color:#c8b17a}.bloom-story h3{font:21px/1.8 'Noto Serif SC',serif;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em}.bloom-story>p{font-size:13px;color:#aebaa4;line-height:2.1;margin-top:20px}.bloom-spec{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font-size:10px;color:#99a88f;margin:30px 0}.bloom-spec em{font:9px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.12em;margin-left:12px;font-style:normal}.text-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;font-size:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #687258;padding-bottom:5px;color:#ded8bf}.feature-caption{grid-column:1/-1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 28px;border-top:1px solid #33473470;color:#9baa91;font-size:10px}.feature-caption span:last-child{font:9px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em}.selected{padding:86px 0 65px}.section-top{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:30px}.section-top h2{font:26px/1.6 'Noto Serif SC',serif;margin-top:12px}.section-top>span{font:10px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#a8b399}.project-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px}.project{min-width:0}.project-image{display:block;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#132a22;aspect-ratio:16/10;border:1px solid #33473490}.project-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transition:transform .45s ease}.image-action{position:absolute;bottom:18px;right:18px;font-size:10px;background:#10241eeb;border:1px solid #72816a70;border-radius:3px;padding:8px 12px}.project-image:hover img{transform:scale(1.025)}.project-copy{padding:24px 0 0}.project-copy h3{font:38px/1.4 'Instrument Serif','Noto Serif SC',serif;margin:10px 0 14px}.project-copy h3>span{font:12px system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-left:16px;color:#b5c0aa}.project-copy>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:13px;line-height:2;color:#adbba5;max-width:490px}.project-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #334734;margin-top:24px;padding-top:16px;font-size:10px;color:#a3b297;gap:10px}.project-foot>a{font-size:11px;color:#e2dcc7;white-space:nowrap}.original-note{font-size:10px;color:#899b80;margin-top:30px}.bridge{border-top:1px solid #334734;padding:65px 0 75px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:22px 60px}.bridge>.eyebrow{grid-column:1/-1}.bridge h2{font:30px/1.7 'Noto Serif SC',serif}.bridge>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:13px;color:#adbba5;line-height:2.1;align-self:center}.bridge>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;grid-column:1/-1}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:35px;padding:12px 20px;background:#d2c194;color:#17261b;font-size:12px;border-radius:3px}.button:hover{background:#e4d5ac}footer{max-width:1360px;margin:auto;padding:25px 56px 35px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid #2c3a30;font-size:10px;color:#a4b098}footer>span{font:9px 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.1em}
  @media(min-width:1440px){.bloom-story h2{font-size:132px}}
  @media(max-width:1000px){nav{padding:24px 30px}main{padding:0 30px}.bloom-story{padding-left:28px}.bloom-story h3{font-size:18px}.work-id{flex-direction:column;align-items:start;gap:7px}.bloom-feature{grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr}.project-foot{align-items:start}.project-foot>span{max-width:160px}.bridge{gap:20px 30px}}
  @media(max-width:700px){nav{padding:20px 22px}.brand{font-size:16px}.brand span{display:none}nav>div{gap:18px;font-size:11px}nav>div>a:last-child{display:none}main{padding:0 22px}.studio-intro{padding:34px 0 28px}.eyebrow{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.08em}h1{font-size:28px;line-height:1.65;margin-top:14px}.mobile-break{display:block}.intro-bottom{display:block;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9}.intro-bottom>a{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;font-size:10px}.bloom-feature{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin:0 -10px}.bloom-story{padding:28px 25px 0}.work-id{flex-direction:row;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-size:8px}.bloom-story h2{font-size:85px;margin:14px 0 4px}.bloom-story h3{font-size:19px}.bloom-story>p{font-size:12px;margin-top:13px}.bloom-story>p br{display:none}.bloom-spec{margin:18px 0;flex-direction:row;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px}.bloom-spec em{font-size:8px;margin-left:6px}.bloom-story>.text-link{font-size:11px}.feature-caption{padding:13px 15px;font-size:9px}.feature-caption span:last-child{display:none}.selected{padding:52px 0 40px}.section-top h2{font-size:21px;margin-top:10px}.section-top>span{display:none}.project-pair{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:42px}.project-image{aspect-ratio:16/10}.project-copy{padding-top:20px}.project-copy h3{font-size:35px}.project-copy>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:12px}.project-foot{font-size:9px}.project-foot>span{max-width:none}.original-note{font-size:9px;line-height:1.9}.bridge{padding:40px 0 45px;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}.bridge h2{font-size:24px}.bridge>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:12px}.bridge>div{gap:20px;margin-top:8px}.bridge .text-link{font-size:10px}.button{padding:11px 16px;gap:20px}footer{padding:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;font-size:9px}footer>span{order:3;width:100%;font-size:8px}}
  @media(max-width:700px){.studio-intro{padding:28px 0 26px}.intro-bottom{margin-top:12px}.intro-bottom .mobile-break{display:none}.intro-bottom>a{display:none}.bloom-story{padding-top:24px}.bloom-story h2{font-size:72px;margin:10px 0 3px}.bloom-story h3{font-size:17px}.bloom-story>p,.bloom-spec{display:none}.bloom-story>.text-link{margin-top:13px}.bloom-feature :global(.bloom){height:445px}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){:global(html){scroll-behavior:auto}.project-image img{transition:none}}
</style>
